/SFML/deployments","created_at":"2011-03-25T08:05:25Z","updated_at":"2025-12-12T10:49:58Z","pushed_at":"2025-12-11T22:20:31Z","git_url":"git://github.com/SFML/SFML.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:SFML/SFML.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/SFML/SFML.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/SFML/SFML","homepage":"https://www.sfml-dev.org/","size":112703,"stargazers_count":11514,"watchers_count":11514,"language":"C++","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":1880,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":162,"license":{"key":"zlib","name":"zlib License","spdx_id":"Zlib","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/zlib","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTI3"},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["audio","c-plus-plus","cross-platform","games","graphics","hacktoberfest","multimedia","opengl","sdk","sfml"],"visibility":"public","forks":1880,"open_issues":162,"watchers":11514,"default_branch":"master","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SFML/SFML/pulls/825","html_url":"https://github.com/SFML/SFML/pull/825","diff_url":"https://github.com/SFML/SFML/pull/825.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/SFML/SFML/pull/825.patch","merged_at":"2015-03-29T20:35:46Z"},"body":"Supersedes #780, #665 and #425.\n- Replaced Xlib event names by XCB equivalents.\n- Fixed mouse grabbing in fullscreen mode. Removed keyboard grabbing to allow the user to \"alt+tab\" out of the window.\n- Added EWMH support when a compliant WM is present. If a compliant WM is present, it will be in charge of setting the fullscreen state, forwarding any system key combinations (alt+whatever), and making sure the application stays responsive (it will prompt the user to kill the process if necessary)\n- If EWMH support is unavailable, the old method of setting fullscreen and removing decorations is used, in this case, system key combinations need to be explicitly handled by the user since OVERRIDE_REDIRECT is necessary\n- In both scenarios, a hard video mode switch is performed before the window enters the fullscreen state\n- Added support for handling rotated display configurations\n\nThis PR should fix\n- #274 - If EWMH is present, alt+f4 will always result in sf::Event::Closed regardless of window style\n- #771 - Rotated screen configurations are enumerated and accepted during window creation\n- #847 - Modified non-alphabetic keys return the unmodified sf::Keyboard values\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SFML/SFML/issues/825/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SFML/SFML/issues/825/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SFML/SFML/issues/comments/86441747","html_url":"https://github.com/SFML/SFML/issues/843#issuecomment-86441747","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SFML/SFML/issues/843","id":86441747,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDg2NDQxNzQ3","user":{"login":"gsfare","id":3404580,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0MDQ1ODA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3404580?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsfare","html_url":"https://github.com/gsfare","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsfare/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsfare/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsfare/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsfare/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsfare/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsfare/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsfare/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsfare/events{/pr